.TH DANBY-SYNCHRONOUSMOTOR 1
.SH NAME
danby-synchronousmotor \- phase locking and pull-out torque
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/synchronousmotor
.SH MODEL
Rotor phase lag obeys a damped driven-pendulum equation. Load below maximum
electromagnetic torque permits a fixed phase lag; above it, phase slips grow
and the rotor pulls out of synchronism.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/danby/synchronousmotor.b
